From 3a85f283a7520d09c9962fcdce78770955179d94 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Grimaldi <vince.ceccarelli@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 13:33:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(brand): inline EW logo as data URI so it can never 404
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The logo 404'd in production even after unoptimized: serving it from
/public/brand made it depend on the deploy serving that path (Vercel monorepo
public-folder resolution + cache), which failed on the live site. Root fix:
inline the mark as a ~2.2KB base64 data URI (lib/brand.ts) rendered with a
plain <img> in the header, footer, and both chat spots. No network request, no
optimizer, no sharp, no /public dependency — it renders the instant the
component mounts, on every deploy. Cream-chip variant so it reads on any
background.
---
 apps/web/app/components/ChatWidget.tsx |  8 +++++---
 apps/web/app/components/Header.tsx     |  5 +++--
 apps/web/app/components/SiteFooter.tsx |  5 +++--
 apps/web/lib/brand.ts                  | 12 ++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 apps/web/lib/brand.ts

